    identical copy.

Portions of src/TargetLinesModule.cpp
    The D3D8 device acquisition and the FFXiMain entity-array signature scan
    follow Broguypal's TargetRing (BSD 3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2026 Broguypal);
    see SceneHook/LICENSE for the licence text.

    The projection, batching and render-state handling follow Genoxd's
    ffxi_world_draw (0BSD, Copyright (c) 2026 Genoxd), which requires no
    attribution but is credited here regardless.

Targeting behaviour
    Ported from Jyouya's Ashita "targetlines" addon
    (https://github.com/Jyouya/targetlines). That repository carries no licence
    file, so no code or assets from it are redistributed here: the packet
    handling is reimplemented against Windower's API, and the beam and orb
    textures are generated at runtime rather than shipped.
